{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a5c1e7f2-8b4d-4c3e-9f61-2d7a0b5e4c18",
    "name": "Actividad 5 - API con JWT",
    "description": "Colección para probar la API de productos con autenticación JWT.\n\nFlujo recomendado:\n1. Ejecutar **Auth > Register** (genera un email aleatorio y lo guarda en la variable `email`).\n2. Ejecutar **Auth > Login** (guarda el token en la variable `token`).\n3. Probar las rutas de **Productos**. Las rutas POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE usan `Bearer {{token}}`.\n4. En **Pruebas de seguridad** se comprueba que un usuario con rol `usuario` recibe 403 al borrar, mientras que el admin recibe 204.\n\nTambién puedes correr toda la colección con el Collection Runner.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Genera un email nuevo en cada ejecución para evitar el 409",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('email', pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$randomEmail}}'));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Usuario creado', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Responde con mensaje', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property('mensaje');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"rol\": \"admin\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Crea un usuario con la contraseña hasheada. El email se genera automáticamente y queda guardado en la variable `email` para el Login."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 Login correcto', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Devuelve un token', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Guarda el token para las rutas protegidas",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.token);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Valida email y contraseña y entrega el JWT. El test guarda el token en la variable de colección `token`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login con clave incorrecta",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('401 Credenciales inválidas', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"clave-incorrecta\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "login"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Productos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET Productos (público)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 Lista de productos', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Devuelve un array', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/productos",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "productos"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "GET Producto por ID (público)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 Producto encontrado', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/productos/{{productoId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "productos",
                "{{productoId}}"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "POST Crear producto (con token)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Producto creado', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Devuelve id, nombre, precio y stock', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(body).to.include.all.keys('id', 'nombre', 'precio', 'stock');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "// Guarda el id para las siguientes peticiones",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('productoId', body.id);"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Producto desde Postman\",\n  \"precio\": 15000,\n  \"stock\": 5\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/productos",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "productos"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Ruta protegida: requiere `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`. Ejecuta Login antes."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT Actualizar producto (con token)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 Producto actualizado', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Datos actualizados', () => {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.nombre).to.eql('Producto actualizado');",
                  "  pm.expect(body.precio).to.eql(20000);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Producto actualizado\",\n  \"precio\": 20000,\n  \"stock\": 8\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/productos/{{productoId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "productos",
                "{{productoId}}"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "PATCH Actualizar stock (con token)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 Stock actualizado', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Stock igual a 3', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().stock).to.eql(3);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"stock\": 3\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/productos/{{productoId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "productos",
                "{{productoId}}"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE Borrar producto (con token)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('204 Producto borrado', () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(204);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/productos/{{productoId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "productos",
                "{{productoId}}"
